                        "glosses": [
                            "In a jolly manner."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "815803e1-81b0-43e9-a581-56943f6e258e",
                                "sense_id": "6c81a317-8277-3b2d-87f7-6848aa7291c2",
                                "text": "[Albert, as scout leader:] Forward! Jollily forward!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0fb8cd28-792a-4a9a-9133-a0209a0a78e0",
                                "sense_id": "6c81a317-8277-3b2d-87f7-6848aa7291c2",
                                "text": "Every servant in the family, from high to low, wished Tom success, and I can fancy, an’ please your honour, I see him this moment with his white dimity waistcoat and breeches, and hat a little o’one side, passing jollily along the street, swinging his stick, with a smile and a cheerful word for every body he met."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8341cf1d-30b0-4648-8660-7f08961dd110",
                                "sense_id": "6c81a317-8277-3b2d-87f7-6848aa7291c2",
                                "text": "There’s a sermon now, writ in high heaven, and the sun goes through it every year, and yet comes out of it all alive and hearty. Jollily he, aloft there, wheels through toil and trouble […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "876a71e2-5335-4484-a9d0-b685d69fd683",
                                "sense_id": "6c81a317-8277-3b2d-87f7-6848aa7291c2",
                                "text": "They stiffened when they saw Hillier, ready to throw him a salute, but he waved at them jollily as he marched through, singing."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
